    "updated_at": "2015-09-30T16:44:17Z",
    "body": "> I think one suggestion for a revamp here would be to exclude this entire API from the developer edition of HTML and thereby remove all the domintro bits. Not going to block on this though if that makes matters too complicated.\n\nThe hard part seems to be excluding the definition of `document.all` from the developer edition. And without a developer edition build process that works, fixing that would be working blind. So I think we should leave that for later.\n",
